</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Our Flywire Annual Conference &amp; Awards Ceremony 2025 is next week, and we can't wait to share this incredible experience with you! There is still time to <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/annual-conference-awards-ceremony-2025?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>register!</u></strong></span></a></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">‌</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">We’ve curated an exciting <strong>agenda</strong> with insightful plenary sessions, interactive workshops, thought-provoking panel discussions, engaging breakout sessions, and our keynote speaker Former SAS Leader &amp; star of SAS: Who Dares Wins! <strong>Colin MacLachlan.</strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">‌‌</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Limited subsidised <strong>accommodation</strong> is available at the De Vere Beaumont Estate - further details available once you've registered for the conference.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">‌</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">We're looking forward to celebrating the sector’s achievements with you at the Annual Awards Ceremony.</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="minw-158 hover-green" style="width: 100%;">
<!--[if mso]>
        <v:roundrect xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" style="height:30pt; v-text-anchor:middle; width:119pt; mso-position-horizontal: center" arcsize="10%" strokecolor="#147BD1" strokeweight="0pt" fillcolor="#147BD1">
          <w:anchorlock/>
          <v:textbox inset="0,0,0,0"><p style="text-align: center; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, Sans-serif; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; line-height: 18px"><![endif]--> 
<!--[if !mso]><!--> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse: initial;"> 
<tbody>
