</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="mob-ps-0" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21px; padding-right: 20px; padding-bottom: 16px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">Join the Flywire Payment Security Community meeting hosted by <strong>Dave Neild, Flywire Lead Security Consultant</strong> to hear the latest insights from the Payment Security team. Each meeting will focus on a hot topic. The first meeting in March will examine opportunities to simplify your Payment Security program by outsourcing to compliant Third Party Service Providers acting as a Merchant of Record, with a focus on payment channels for both e-commerce and physical devices.</p> </td> 
</tr> 
